@startuml
title Validate a plugin submission
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "GitHub Actions" as H
participant "Repository" as P
participant "Node Scripts" as N
participant "Artifact Store" as T
participant "Issue" as I

H -> P: checkout
H -> H: setup-node + npm ci
H -> N: node scripts/intake-submission.mjs
N --> H: parsed submission
H -> N: validate-submission.mjs + catalog-verification.mjs
N --> H: validation reports
H -> T: upload validation-reports artifact
H -> I: comment pass/fail
note over H: A failed validation blocks the approval workflow.
@enduml
